:2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"79OES-kMb3VGsdy0nG6G2g","review_id":"Uv8iOWxqn_FnPxmFrvq8TQ","date":"2016-06-28T23:11:31","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9343644976615906,"text_excerpt":"Great local spot to get some work done and enjoy great coffee. I got their latte on my recent visit and it was really solid - a little strong for me, but perfect for full-time coffee lovers I'd imagine. Other times I've gotten a mocha and a cappuccino, which were both solid. They have a nice and friendly atmosphere as well as service. There seem to be regulars as well, whom the staff are really friendly with, enhancing a real nice neighborhood feel. This is a great place to just hang out for a bit, on the front patio or inside, with a great amount of space. They have small treats, too, but I never tried them, although they look delicious."},{"business_id":"79OES-kMb3VGsdy0nG6G2g","review_id":"ZDaO05mKmoBOzIeN6qA60Q","date":"2012-06-03T15:48:05","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9324938654899597,"text_excerpt":"LOVE this place -- anywhere I can take my dog and sit on the porch, get some work done and do a little people watching is my kind of coffee shop. The staff is very friendly, and if you want to escape the heat, they've got a lot of spots indoors. Things I love for students - lots of outlets, free wifi, great coffee, and great snacks. Also -- try their breakfast! I love a breakfast sandwich, and theirs is amazing. Eggs, cheddar, bacon, pesto..? Not much more I can ask for! and the fact that they're locally owned (which I love.. way better than Starbucks anyday), makes it perfect for me.. and my dog."},{"business_id":"79OES-kMb3VGsdy0nG6G2g","review_id":"jX8Ivmk1T1Pk6r98GCygyQ","date":"2011-07-17T17:36:53","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9272834062576294,"text_excerpt":"This place is adorable! This is my first time here (I'm still inside, experiencing it...) and I think this is my new stop when I need some coffee and a place to get work done. It has such a cute, homey atmosphere and I'm seriously figuring out a way to get these fireplaces home with me. Window maybe? Anybody got a truck? The barista is so nice and the iced lattes are even nicer. (Sorry nice barista, you're still awesome.) They have a great selection of pastries and a small selection of sandwiches which I haven't experienced but the choices aren't the standard fare. I definitely recommend this place if you want to grab breakfast, lunch, or just relax and do some homework/facebook stalking."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"79OES-kMb3VGsdy0nG6G2g","photo_id":"4ZpnmavLkqyHmDASn6hYgQ","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/4ZpnmavLkqyHmDASn6hYgQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.869833767414093},{"business_id":"79OES-kMb3VGsdy0nG6G2g","photo_id":"Z7pBMMultOww3O0bZttvSA","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/Z7pBMMultOww3O0bZttvSA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8311306834220886},{"business_id":"79OES-kMb3VGsdy0nG6G2g","photo_id":"QQXr6W5CsaBPYUgxE-VC1g","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/QQXr6W5CsaBPYUgxE-VC1g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8237569332122803},{"business_id":"79OES-kMb3VGsdy0nG6G2g","photo_id":"w79Oml7zLGZKIr-xHFXqNA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/w79Oml7zLGZKIr-xHFXqNA.jpg","visual_representativeness":